@startuml
title RADAR Analyzer API - High-Level Architecture
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

[Program.cs] as Program
[Startup and DI\nServiceCollectionExtensions.cs\nWebApplicationExtensions.cs] as Startup
[HTTP Controllers\napi/*] as Controllers
[Application Services\nRisk, Investigation, Mail,\nWorkflow, Policy, Settings] as Services
[Background Workers\nAnalyzer, IMAP, Workflow, Jobs] as Workers
database "PostgreSQL\nAnalyzerDbContext" as Database
queue "Redis" as Redis
cloud "External Systems\nLDAP, IMAP, SMTP, DLP,\nAI, Splunk" as External

Program --> Startup
Startup --> Controllers : configure HTTP pipeline
Startup --> Services : register dependencies
Startup --> Workers : start hosted services
Controllers --> Services : request handling
Services --> Database : read and write
Services --> Redis : stream and cache
Services --> External : integrations
Workers --> Services : scheduled execution

note bottom of Controllers
  Detailed request routes:
  analyzer-request-flow.puml
end note
note bottom of Workers
  Detailed worker routes:
  analyzer-background-workers.puml
end note
@enduml
